===================================================
    
1-1. Fixed NUMERIC + Fixed NUMERIC => Float NUMERIC     

===================================================
cast(2 as numeric(1,0))+ cast(1.1 as numeric(2,1))    typeof( cast(2 as numeric(1,0))+ cast(1.1 as numeric(2,1)))    
3.1     numeric     

===================================================
    
1-2. Fixed NUMERIC + Float NUMERIC => Float NUMERIC     

===================================================
cast(2 as numeric(1,0))+ cast(1.1 as numeric)    typeof( cast(2 as numeric(1,0))+ cast(1.1 as numeric))    
3.1     numeric     

===================================================
    
1-3. Fixed NUMERIC + FLOAT => DOUBLE     

===================================================
cast(2 as numeric(1,0))+ cast(1.1 as float)    typeof( cast(2 as numeric(1,0))+ cast(1.1 as float))    
3.100000024     double     

===================================================
    
1-4. Fixed NUMERIC + DOUBLE => DOUBLE     

===================================================
cast(2 as numeric(1,0))+ cast(1.1 as double)    typeof( cast(2 as numeric(1,0))+ cast(1.1 as double))    
3.1     double     

===================================================
    
2-1. Float NUMERIC + Float NUMERIC => Float NUMERIC     

===================================================
cast(2 as numeric)+ cast(1.1 as numeric)    typeof( cast(2 as numeric)+ cast(1.1 as numeric))    
3.1     numeric     

===================================================
    
2-2. Float NUMERIC + FLOAT => DOUBLE     

===================================================
cast(2 as numeric)+ cast(1.1 as float)    typeof( cast(2 as numeric)+ cast(1.1 as float))    
3.100000024     double     

===================================================
    
2-3. Float NUMERIC + DOUBLE => DOUBLE     

===================================================
cast(2 as numeric)+ cast(1.1 as double)    typeof( cast(2 as numeric)+ cast(1.1 as double))    
3.1     double     

===================================================
    
3-1. high-precision Float NUMERIC + Float NUMERIC preserves full precision     

===================================================
cast(0.12345678901234567890123456789012345678 as numeric)+ cast(1 as numeric)    typeof( cast(0.12345678901234567890123456789012345678 as numeric)+ cast(1 as numeric))    
1.12345678901234567890123456789012345678     numeric     

===================================================
    
3-2. high-precision Float NUMERIC + DOUBLE collapses to DOUBLE (precision loss)     

===================================================
cast(0.12345678901234567890123456789012345678 as numeric)+ cast(1 as double)    typeof( cast(0.12345678901234567890123456789012345678 as numeric)+ cast(1 as double))    
1.123456789     double     

===================================================
    
3-3. NUMERIC with -, *, / (division is numeric, not integer)     

===================================================
cast(2 as numeric)- cast(1 as numeric)    typeof( cast(2 as numeric)- cast(1 as numeric))    
1     numeric     

===================================================
cast(2 as numeric)* cast(3 as numeric)    typeof( cast(2 as numeric)* cast(3 as numeric))    
6     numeric     

===================================================
cast(1 as numeric)/ cast(3 as numeric)    typeof( cast(1 as numeric)/ cast(3 as numeric))    
0.3333333333333333333333333333333333333333     numeric     

===================================================
    
3-4. NUMERIC arithmetic overflow beyond Float NUMERIC range (error)     

===================================================
Error:-730
